# A part of the program unit_s7_part_root_below_definition.lm2
# (steps/table-receiver.md, section 10): bump names k, a field of the part's
# root declared below it and so not visible to it. peek, below the
# declaration, reads the field.
fn: bump () int
    k: 7
    return: 0
int: k 5
fn: peek () int
    return: k
